        "id": 1107893
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-14T08:13:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for checking. That 68 size makes sense in the context of that RFC. That also includes IPv6 which has a fixed IP header size.\n\nSo we can change the check to `mtu \u003e\u003d 68`.\n\n\u003e  do you prefer to set mtu to 1500 or stay unchanged when invalid value is input?\n\nIn case of invalid value, we should return false and log the error.",
      "parentUuid": "2cd330aa_2a400625",
